# 📊 Digital Financial Product & Transaction Performance Analytics

## 📌 Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing the business and transaction performance of digital financial products 
(QRIS, Top Up, Bill Payment, Loan Revenue, Gold Savings, and Money Transfer). 

It covers the full end-to-end data analytics lifecycle: 
**Data Pipeline & Cleansing**, 
**Interactive BI Dashboard (Looker Studio)**, 
**SQL Data Querying**, and a structured 
**Root Cause Analysis (RCA)** 
framework to solve real-world business challenges.

